67-## 2. Skill Selection
68-
69:Choose one primary skill first.
70-
71-### 2.1 `coding-core`
--
163-
164-Use when:
165:- multi-agent or A2A coordination is the main execution problem
166:- topology selection, delegation boundaries, or lifecycle control matters more than raw domain analysis
167-- agent discovery, agent-card review, or capability-fit selection is central
168-- long-running async coordination needs explicit state, join, and accountability control
